From da74078a354cd7e66961fa4c57cae99bb036226b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 17:26:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/40] Link InputFlinger against libinputreader_arc for ARC
 input bridge
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace stock libinputreader with libinputreader_arc which provides
InputReaderArc — a pipe-based input reader that receives events from
SurfaceFlinger's Wayland service instead of EventHub.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Idf3a58e4e86b88efee5e13a0929fda11d0f23447
---
 services/inputflinger/Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/services/inputflinger/Android.bp b/services/inputflinger/Android.bp
index 41878e3487..67a1752a66 100644
--- a/services/inputflinger/Android.bp
+++ b/services/inputflinger/Android.bp
@@ -108,7 +108,7 @@ cc_library_shared {
         // in cc_defaults so that they are included in the tests.
         "libinputflinger_base",
         "libinputreporter",
-        "libinputreader",
+        "libinputreader_arc",
         "libgui",
     ],
     static_libs: [
